{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114123305167-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114125559\"/><p>老婦受傷倒地。</p><p>牛頭角發生交通意外。今午(14日)12時17分，一輛客貨車沿通明街行駛，至準備右轉入牛頭角道一行人過路處時，撞倒一名老婦，事主受傷當場陷入昏迷。救護車接報到場將老婦送院救治，涉事司機在場助查肇事原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T05:20:02.176253+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T04:33:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T05:13:28.399157+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T05:13:28.399157+00:00","content_hash":"2c6dc6e84fdbef15daf9bdefa3ec1f9c23f71b70fd20d89e71d3526735280b9a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}